Display Modules Support Connected Electronics

LCMs combine an LCD panel with elements such as driver electronics, backlighting, interfaces and, in some products, touch functionality or optical bonding. They range from simple numerical displays to high-resolution modules used in computing, industrial control and vehicle dashboards.

Their continued relevance reflects cost efficiency, broad manufacturing availability and long product lifecycles.

LCD Technology Serves Multiple Application Requirements

TFT-LCD remains important for high-resolution and color applications, while segment and character displays serve simpler low-power devices. OLED provides competition in premium consumer products, particularly where thin form factors and high contrast are priorities.

